":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-06-20T12:39:04Z","updated_at":"2026-07-29T21:43:55Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nreproducible in godot 4.7\ndiscovered when migrating a project from 4.6 to 4.7\nnot reproducible in 4.6\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Godot Engine v4.7.stable.official.5b4e0cb0f - D3D12 12_0 - Forward+ - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4050 Laptop GPU\n\n### Issue description\n\nwhen an animation interpolates the frame property on a Sprite2D, if the animations are switched with an AnimationTree state machine, if the transitions' switch_mode is set to sync it causes this error:\n\nset_frame: Index p_frame = 27 is out of bounds (vframes * hframes = 25).\n <C++ Source>  scene/2d/sprite_2d.cpp:299 @ set_frame()\n\nNote that p_frame in the error is usually either double the value of the first frame in the animation, or double plus 1\n\nAside from flooding the debugger with errors, the animations work as intended\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a Sprite2D node with an AnimationPlayer and AnimationTree\n2. In the AnimationPlayer create at least 2 looped animations that interpolate Sprite2D's frame property\n3. Set the AnimationTree tree_root property to an AnimationNodeStateMachine\n4. Place your animations and connect them to each other with AnimationNodeStateMachineTransitions\n5. Set the advance expression to any condition, set switch_mode to sync\n6. Play the project and trigger transitions\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29160907/mrp.zip)\n\nOn playing the project it should immediately push an error into the debugger\nIn the mrp I was able to reproduce it only on the first play of the animation, but in my project migrated from 4.6 to 4.7 it seems to affect random animations, without triggering the error on some animations at all, and always triggering it when playing others.\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120480/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120480/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}